Apply a graph plan, committing local checkpoints only after server ACKs

Usage: aws-inventory graph-push [OPTIONS] --input <INPUT>

Options:
      --input <INPUT>            
      --checkpoint <CHECKPOINT>  [default: projection.sqlite]
      --url-env <URL_ENV>        [default: FALKORDB_URL]
      --attempts <ATTEMPTS>      Total attempts per graph batch, including its first attempt [default: 5]
  -h, --help                     Print help
